            "text": "  rule prefixesAcc(S:IntSeq, END:Int, STOP:Int, ACC:ValSeq)\n    => prefixesAcc(\n         S,\n         END +Int 1,\n         STOP,\n         valSeqConcat(\n           ACC,\n           vCons(doSlice(str(S), noB, someB(END), noB), .ValSeq)))\n    requires END <Int STOP"
