            "start_line": 39,
            "text": "  rule allPrefixesBody()\n    => Expr(Str(\"Return all nonempty prefixes of string, shortest first.\"))\n       Assign(Name(\"prefixes\"), ListExpr(.Exprs))\n       For(\n         Name(\"end\"),\n         Call(\n           Name(\"range\"),\n           Int(1),\n           BinOp(\"+\", Call(Name(\"len\"), Name(\"string\")), Int(1))),\n         allPrefixesLoopBody())\n       Return(Name(\"prefixes\"))\n       .Stmts"
